<br />

<br />
Dark Inheritance and Dark Realms Alliance Members and those applying to D.I. may attend.  This is a closed raid.  No guests except as noted above.
<br />

<br />
Start:  9PM EST Sharp
<br />

<br />
Location:  Ice Huts infront of TOFS - Camp there the night before if you need to, but at 9:15 SHARP we are going in.
<br />

<br />
Be sure you know our Raid Bible or don't come.   Yes I am serious <img src="images/smiles/icon_smile.gif" alt="icon_smile.gif" border="0" />
<br />

<br />
Link: <a href="http://darkinheritance.com/raidbible.html" target="_blank" class="postlink">Raid Bible</a>
<br />

<br />
You MUST own Luclin to attend, we will be using the raid window on all D.I. hosted raids.
<br />

<br />
Main Assist:  Serrik
<br />

<br />
Second Assist:  To be announced
<br />

<br />
Loot Rules:
<br />

<br />
D.I. will be reserving the first key to the 6th floor we obtain.  We will give the 2nd key to DOTLR for their guild use as determined by its leadership.
<br />

<br />
All loot will be handled according to Dark Inheritance loot policy.  Be sure you have read our loot policy or don't come.  Yes, I am serious <img src="images/smiles/icon_smile.gif" alt="icon_smile.gif" border="0" />
<br />

<br />

<br />
Link: <a href="http://darkinheritance.com/lootrules.html" target="_blank" class="postlink">D.I. Loot Policy</a>
<br />

<br />
We will use the raid window and count down the names in order to roll and determine winners in the fastest manner possible.
<br />

<br />
The Plan:
<br />

<br />
Tserina dies
<br />

<br />
YOU MUST sign up to attend.
<br />

<br />
Limited spaces on this one due to keys needed.
<br />

<br />
Group 1
<br />

<br />
Serrik 55 Monk
<br />
